WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.033
-This is big, actually.
I saw that the daytime TV show,

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:05.200
"Maury," is ending.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.367
-Oh.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.567
-Yeah. 31 years on the air
is quite a run.

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:10.667
-Oh, man. That's a shame.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.434
"Maury" has been, like,
my favorite show.

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:13.801
-What?

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:15.834
That's not true.

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:17.234
"Maury" is not
your favorite show.

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:19.501
I bet you've never even seen
an episode, you liar.

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:22.300
-[ Scoffs ] Don't you call me
a liar!

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.501
You don't even know me!
You're the liar!

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:25.501
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:27.901
-No, no, no, no, no. No.
You're the liar.

00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:29.968
-Whoa!
-You are!

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:32.868
-Hey, hold on, guys, guys,
calm down, guys.

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:35.334
-Know what? I don't need this.

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:37.300
[Bleep] all y'all.
-Wait, wait, wait, what?!

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.534
-Oh, yeah! You heard me!
-Boo!

00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:40.567
-Boo!
-Boo him!

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:42.801
-No, no, no, no, no, no! No!

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:45.934
I don't need any of you!
[ Shouts ]

00:00:45.934 --> 00:00:48.067
Forget it! [ Fake crying ]

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:53.133
-You better run! Man, that's all
you ever do, is run!

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:56.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:59.133
-[ Fake crying ]

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:05.601
-Higgins.

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.734
You can't just storm out
every time you get upset.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.934
-You're right.
-You know, you have to learn to

00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:12.534
confront your problem,
you know that?

00:01:12.534 --> 00:01:16.100
-Yeah, I know that.
-You ready to go back out there?

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.033
Let's do it. Let's go back out
there.

00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:20.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:20.534 --> 00:01:21.634
Come on.

00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:24.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:27.667
-[ Continues fake crying ]

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:35.767
-That's alright.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:44.501
Now, we're going to get to
the bottom of this.

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:46.601
Higgins actually took
a lie detector test

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:49.801
before the show to prove
if he actually watches "Maury."

00:01:50.968 --> 00:01:53.434
Alright, and here are
the results.

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:57.868
When asked, "Is 'Maury'
your favorite show?"

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:00.367
Higgins said yes.

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:08.934
The lie detector determined
that was...

00:02:08.934 --> 00:02:10.534
a lie!
-Yeah!

00:02:10.534 --> 00:02:12.000
-No!
-Yes! I told you!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.801
-No!
-[ Cheering ]

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.701
-No! No! That's not --

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:20.000
Come on!
-Also, also,

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.968
our paternity test determined
you're the father

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:25.133
of 28 illegitimate children.

00:02:25.133 --> 00:02:26.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:26.901 --> 00:02:28.634
-I knew that.
-Oh, okay.

00:02:28.634 --> 00:02:30.901
Alright, Steve Higgins,
Tariq Trotter, everybody.

00:02:30.901 --> 00:02:34.067
Stick around, we're playing
charades with Leslie Mann

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:36.634
and Mikey Day when we come back,
everybody.

00:02:36.634 --> 00:02:41.634
♪♪

